 is possibly a much better method at achieving this behavior. At this stage I'm happy to admit I'm a bit ignorant on the subject; but I've spent many days researching and trying.<br><br>It seems I've been able to learn so much but I don't even know where to begin here <img class="smilies" src="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/images/smilies/icon_smile.gif" width="15" height="15" alt=":)" title="Smile"> Thank you for your time<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=13322">nev6502</a> — Sun Jun 16, 2019 6:06 am</p><hr />
